,"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以你为什么不把受伤的事情告诉我们呢。在那么激烈的战斗里受伤，也不算是什么丢人的事吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":680,"transTime":300,"y":14,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara023_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]我只是不想被别人看到受伤的样子。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":680,"transTime":300,"y":14,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara023_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"愿意讲讲吗？","tag":"tag_19"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":680,"transTime":300,"y":14,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara023_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[cm][show]如果是讲给你们听的话……也可以。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]在我很小的时候，我被一支由荒野客组成的佣兵团收养。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1c","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]佣兵团里信奉弱肉强食。我小时候又瘦又弱，没法上场战斗，只能做些苦力杂活，一直被团里其他人欺负。那段日子光是回想起来就让我觉得难受。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]我好几次想逃都没有成功。后来佣兵团在大兽潮中被冲散，我也终于找到机会逃了出来。在流浪了一段时间后，我被巴诺姆的村民们收留了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]虽然换了生活环境，但是我无法忘记在佣兵团受苦的日子。而且越是在自卫团里战斗，越是感觉到弱肉强食的道理到哪里都是一样的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]如果不想再被欺负，就一定要变强。必须用实力证明自己，这样才不会被任何人小看。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]所以每次战斗我都非常卖力，绝不能让看人看到我软弱的一面……自然，也绝不会因为受伤就哭哭啼啼……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":680,"transTime":300,"y":14,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara023_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来如此，这就是你瞒着大家的原因啊。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"